    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live in a tranquil and harmonious fruit paradise, but suddenly, the tranquility is shattered by a horde of bubble monsters that have devoured tons of fruit!<br>As a juice enthusiast, you decide to take revenge on the bubble monsters and reclaim the lost juice! Build your deck, summon your minion army, and engage in fierce battles against endless bubbles. Pop the bubbles, release the juice, and save the fruit world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding &amp; Auto-Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and arrange your cards to construct a powerful deck. During battle, your deck will automatically cycle through, playing cards to summon minions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wide Variety of Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run features a randomly generated selection of cards, allowing for diverse deck-building and powerful synergies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your class</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class has a unique set of cards with different playstyles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus on fighting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to collect loot \u2014 just focus on fighting! Fight until enough enemies are killed, then head to the shop to prepare for the next wave!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live in a tranquil and harmonious fruit paradise, but suddenly, the tranquility is shattered by a horde of bubble monsters that have devoured tons of fruit!<br>As a juice enthusiast, you decide to take revenge on the bubble monsters and reclaim the lost juice! Build your deck, summon your minion army, and engage in fierce battles against endless bubbles. Pop the bubbles, release the juice, and save the fruit world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding &amp; Auto-Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and arrange your cards to construct a powerful deck. During battle, your deck will automatically cycle through, playing cards to summon minions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wide Variety of Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run features a randomly generated selection of cards, allowing for diverse deck-building and powerful synergies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your class</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class has a unique set of cards with different playstyles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus on fighting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to collect loot \u2014 just focus on fighting! Fight until enough enemies are killed, then head to the shop to prepare for the next wave!</p></li></ul>",
